WEBVTT

NOTE
The Deling City parade spectacle — Edea's magic display and the saluting Galbadian troops.
Duration: approximately 37 seconds.

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000
Overhead shot: Edea’s throne as Seifer Almasy stands beside it, gun raised toward the sky as the camera follows his motion.

00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:10.000
Close-up of Seifer Almasy, a handsome blond man with a distinctive scar across his face.

00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:13.000
Cyber-samurai dancer mysteriously dances

00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:18.000
The camera cuts back to Seifer Almasy as he runs his fingers through his blond hair.

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:21.000
The camera moves away from Edea’s throne, passing through the parade.

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:25.000
Irvine leads the way as he and Squall sneak past Edea’s throne.

00:00:27.000 --> 00:00:35.000
Irvine and Squall slip through the crowd and into a back alley.